\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {5}{\ignorespaces OCP solver-time distributions and minimum executed-state ESDF margins for Stretch (top) and mobile UR10 (bottom). Solver-time histograms use 10-ms bins, with finer ticks over 0--200~ms. In the margin panels, vertical dashed lines separate the base-motion phase from T1 (Approach), T2 (Reach Low), and T3 (Reach Side). The 120-ms line shows the shared controller validity-window reference; the zero-margin line denotes each profile's own configured collision boundary.}}{8}{figure.5}\protected@file@percent }
